   "en": "New Zealand is located in the Pacific Ocean, just east of Australia and south of ⟦0⟧ New Caledonia and the United Kingdom's Fiji islands. New Zealand consists of two moderately-sized island ⟦1⟧ connected by a single strait. New Zealand owns Samoa, an island chain composed of two provinces, both of which are plains, located northeast of Fiji.",
